        "dimensions": [
          "syntax",
          "concept"
        ],
        "text": "need to resolve说明待办动作；scope issue是宾语；before signing off要求先解决、后批准。 范围问题可能涉及做什么或不做什么，但原句没给出争点。解决应有足以支持共同理解的结果，而非仅结束讨论。",
        "sourceRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "oewn-2025",
            "sourceVersion": "2025",
            "locator": "entries-r.json/resolve/v / resolve%2:31:01::",
            "supportedClaim": "bring to an end; settle conclusively",
            "url": "https://en-word.net/"
          }
        ],
        "title": "句子结构与当前所指"
      },
      {
        "blockId": "contrast",
        "dimensions": [
          "contrast"
        ],
        "text": "discuss an issue是讨论；resolve an issue是解决。decide to do something属于resolve to另一结构；本句不是名词决心。",
        "sourceRefs": [],
        "title": "容易混淆的地方"
      },
      {
        "blockId": "game-neighbors",
        "dimensions": [
          "languageGame",
          "englishNeighbors"
        ],
        "text": "应明确争点、需要的决定以及谁确认结果，再进入批准步骤；不能把会议开完当成争议已解决。 scope clarification有助于解决；agreed scope记录结论；sign off是这里被前提限制的后续动作。",
        "sourceRefs": [],
        "title": "讨论通常怎样继续"
      },
      {
        "blockId": "action",
        "dimensions": [
          "pragmaticAction"
        ],
        "text": "说话者在指出批准前必须完成的问题处理。",
        "sourceRefs": [],
        "title": "说话者正在做什么"
      },
      {
        "blockId": "workplace",
        "dimensions": [
          "workplaceUse"
        ],
        "text": "下面是迁移到制造业沟通的新例句；不代表原场景中已发生的决定。",
